cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Subdiffusive process: a Lean 4 formalization of anomalous scaling limits in a log-correlated potential"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of process convergence, quantitative
  homogenization and anomalous Hölder regularity for a Brownian particle in
  a log-correlated random potential. Release-candidate verification is pending.
authors:
